pkg:Evidence_v1_52_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.52.0 (adapted to BRSF v1.191.0; mission now eligible for closure)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: adapted this register to BRSF's own real, substantial framework evolution (v1.180.0-v1.191.0, lineage discipline v29->v41, SHACL v1.87.0->v1.94.0), per owner direction to read and adapt before proceeding. Re-ran the real validator under the new standard: 4 real violations. Root-caused with the framework's own new backlog_lineage_compass tool: 2 of 3 flagged objectives carried a real, pre-existing scale-mismatch bug (boolean 0/1 recorded against a real 0-4/0-2 count scale), producing a false 'regressed' compass reading -- found and corrected, not defended. Fixed with fresh, correctly-scaled, freshly-verified observations for all 3 objectives, including the new measurement-on-close requirement for STORY-16's own closure. Re-ran the compass tool after the fix: this lineage's mission is now genuinely ELIGIBLE for Out_Achieved, all 9 objectives MET. Reported, not acted on unilaterally, following the same discipline the framework's own changelog demonstrates for this exact situation. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register CONFORMANT (0 violations) against the current, real v1.94.0 SHACL."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "0cbfb488d57da0653763f796d75daa40050e3f5322316b7819f5cc64b0370f8f"^^xsd:string .
